From aead672fbcf92524ce43efd9b0e6c7c858e98472 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felicitas Pojtinger <felicitas@pojtinger.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:42:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add machine lifecycle controls to the machine page

Signed-off-by: Felicitas Pojtinger <felicitas@pojtinger.com>
